41:36.390 --> 41:46.916
[SPEAKER_01]: between a fairing harness and a harness without sharing that's my experience a bit about it if you're failing hands up on a on a c or a d glider

41:46.936 --> 41:55.322
[SPEAKER_01]: hands up all the time if both harness are streamlined the difference is negligible it's really negligible over maybe five kilometers or ten

41:55.342 --> 42:05.909
