48:47.517 --> 49:00.042
[SPEAKER_01]: gain a bit. But that's it. It stays around. That's better. Jeez, man. That's such a cool way of giving back to the community. If I fly and I land

49:00.442 --> 49:09.937
[SPEAKER_01]: and I'm smiling, why not everyone else smiles? Indeed. Zayed,

49:10.297 --> 49:20.925
[SPEAKER_00]: one last question that we ask our guests to share always on the show. That is, one single flight that has stuck with you that can stand out from all

