[SPEAKER_01]: magical moment. And this mountain had the color of brown. It's a brown color, orange. And the sun was setting and the colors were amazing. And I

49:55.581 --> 50:07.712
[SPEAKER_01]: stayed at 3,000 meters, soaring the mountain, maybe until the sunset. This was a beautiful experience for me. wasn't just alone peaceful 3000

50:07.772 --> 50:18.476
[SPEAKER_00]: meters and above and sitting those kind of small experiences yeah i like them and i think with that we have come to the end of the show so any final

50:18.536 --> 50:25.799
[SPEAKER_00]: thoughts before we wrap up although you have shared all your wisdom in the most unfiltered and honest manner so i think it's a massive thanks

50:25.819 --> 50:34.700
[SPEAKER_00]: from every one of us here at paragliding atlas the ball is in your court now thank you very much for having me on your show It was a pleasure. One

50:34.740 --> 50:45.388
